# Force LF line endings in the repository AND on checkout, on every platform. Without
# this, a Windows dev machine with core.autocrlf=true checks files out with CRLF while
# Linux CI checks out the LF blob unchanged — same file, different bytes, different
# hash. That silently broke the retrieval-regression baselines in evaluation_datasets/
# baselines/, whose dataset_md5 is computed from the file's raw bytes: the baseline was
# frozen from a CRLF working copy, so CI's LF checkout could never match it, regardless
# of any real retrieval-quality change.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.json text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.toml text eol=lf
*.txt text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.pdf binary
*.pptx binary
*.docx binary
